# NEVER commit trader data, or anything derived from one trader's history.
# Tradebooks and per-trader findings live outside this repo, under the deletion
# runbook (docs/runbooks/data-deletion.md). Git history cannot be deleted on
# request, so a trader fact committed here breaks the promise made to recruits.
#
# Everything under data/ is ignored except the synthetic paths below (TICKET-930):
# a file dropped anywhere else in data/ cannot be committed by accident.
data/*
!data/fixtures/
!data/golden/
!data/market/
data/market/*
!data/market/CROSSINGS.md
# A synthetic research run (planted signal, fixed seed; scripts/run_null_rate_b2.py).
# Kept while the research seat wants it; remove these two lines to stop tracking it.
!data/null_rate/
raw/
private/

# Data file types, ignored anywhere in the tree: tradebooks, broker contract notes
# (.pdf), exports and databases.
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.parquet
*.zip
*.jsonl
*.pdf
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-*

# Synthetic fixtures and their goldens are the only data files allowed.
# They contain no real trader's trades.
!data/fixtures/**
!data/golden/**
!data/null_rate/**
!tests/fixtures/**

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.env
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store

# Build output
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# local development: keys, database and encrypted file store
.dev-env
scope.db
scope.db-wal
scope.db-shm
_files/

# the concierge mirror report generator writes here
out/
data/files/
